{"data":{"id":"kazkI7RzQ5g","slug":"toro-y-moi","title":"Toro y Moi","artwork":null,"tracks":[{"id":"vrBzZK6dfos","slug":"miss-me-feat-abra","title":"Miss me (Feat. ABRA)"},{"id":"xp176E5v_ho","slug":"day-one","title":"Day One"},{"id":"KibS94XPXjo","slug":"saturday-love","title":"Saturday Love"},{"id":"_0jDI--AE7Y","slug":"grown-up-calls","title":"Grown Up Calls"},{"id":"eQIXtUTKgzs","slug":"fax-shadow-shlohmo-remix","title":"Fax Shadow (Shlohmo Remix)"},{"id":"YkYI6KyWXsY","slug":"tides","title":"Tides"},{"id":"Yu1oVgLhYnc","slug":"still-sound","title":"Still Sound"},{"id":"gFWTsawijRg","slug":"high-living","title":"High Living"},{"id":"mH77pqigv_A","slug":"7-21-17-substitute-hifi-v3","title":"7-21-17_substitute_hifi_v3"},{"id":"G1-hPO01Dyw","slug":"drip-bounce-7-24-18","title":"Drip Bounce _ 7_24_18"},{"id":"PXcuclFIUEo","slug":"day-one-joe-kays-2nd-phase-slowed-vibe","title":"Day One (Joe Kay's 2nd Phase Slowed Vibe)"},{"id":"W5ZATDEE4AQ","slug":"b-elijah-therapy-v2-feat-elijah-kessler","title":"b_elijah_therapy_v2 (feat. Elijah Kessler)"},{"id":"pYv44AkfaMs","slug":"driving-day","title":"Driving Day"},{"id":"Osvl3JNpSeo","slug":"grown-up-calls-live","title":"Grown Up Calls (Live)"},{"id":"EpbOx2AHANc","slug":"so-many-details","title":"So Many Details"},{"id":"aV2uvnpJ580","slug":"day-one-instrumental","title":"Day One (Instrumental)"},{"id":"SBMY44ny7Ak","slug":"grown-up-calls-instrumental","title":"Grown Up Calls (Instrumental)"},{"id":"-oKP0GuyKf0","slug":"zeiss-hifi-v2-feat-caleon-fox","title":"zeiss_hifi_v2 (feat. Caleon Fox)"}]},"markers":[{"id":"4PJFLC6uyL4","position":23,"timestamp":"00:40:23","rawTrack":"Toro y Moi - Driving Day","track":{"id":"pYv44AkfaMs","path":"/artists/toro-y-moi/tracks/driving-day/","slug":"driving-day","title":"Driving Day","artist":{"slug":"toro-y-moi","title":"Toro y Moi"},"artwork":"images/artists/toro-y-moi/tracks/driving-day.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"ymbEftQiGo8","slug":"all-day-2020","tags":[19],"links":{},"state":"published","title":"Soulection All Day 2020","artwork":"/images/episodes/soulection-all-day-2020.jpg","content":"\n**🎊🌟 Happy New Year 2020 🌟🎊**\n\nA day of exclusive mixes from [Joe Kay's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#joe-kays-set), [Sasha Marie](/episodes/all-day-2020/#sasha-maries-set), [Budgie](/episodes/all-day-2020/#budgies-set), and [Skinny Macho](/episodes/all-day-2020/#skinny-machos-set) to bring in the new decade. \n<!--more-->\n\n#### Jump to:\n\n- [Joe Kay's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#joe-kays-set)\n- [Sasha Marie's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#sasha-maries-set)\n- [Budgie's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#budgies-set)\n- [Skinny Macho's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#skinny-machos-set)\n\nAlso listen to [Soulection All Day 2019](/episodes/all-day-2019/).\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2020-01-01T14:41:45+00:00"},"title":"Sasha Marie's Set","position":1}},{"id":"ObXft6ExP5A","position":134,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Toro Y Moi - So Many Details","track":{"id":"EpbOx2AHANc","path":"/artists/toro-y-moi/tracks/so-many-details/","slug":"so-many-details","title":"So Many Details","artist":{"slug":"toro-y-moi","title":"Toro y Moi"},"artwork":"images/artists/toro-y-moi/tracks/so-many-details.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"uvJZqSGqvgU","slug":"boilerroom-streaming-from-isolation-14","tags":[6,3],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/joekay/jboiler-room-streaming-from-isolation-14"},"state":"published","title":"Boilerroom - Joe Kay 4 hour Streaming from Isolation #14","artwork":null,"content":"Joe Kay appears on BoilerRoom Live Streaming from Isolation sessions.\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\n[Please support here if you can.](https://business.facebook.com/donate/219168332618496/)\n\nDuring the pandemic, tune into our new live series Streaming From Isolation. These broadcasts will stream from artists’ homes and private spaces, direct to our audience and without the need for interaction with production teams - as we practice social distancing to remove risk from our programming.\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2020-04-10T20:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's 4 hour experiance","position":0}},{"id":"NmyzN_S9mYg","position":4,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Toro y Moi - Grown Up Calls","track":{"id":"_0jDI--AE7Y","path":"/artists/toro-y-moi/tracks/grown-up-calls/","slug":"grown-up-calls","title":"Grown Up Calls","artist":{"slug":"toro-y-moi","title":"Toro y Moi"},"artwork":"images/artists/toro-y-moi/tracks/grown-up-calls.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"ERHQ6OgFWgc","slug":"discord-1-year-anniversary","tags":[10,3,10],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soul-lyfans/sets/soulection-discord-1-year"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Discord 1 Year Anniversary","artwork":"/images/episodes/discord-1-year-anniversary/cover.jpg","content":"\nSoulection Discord turns 1 year, we celebrate with community DJ mix sets.\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nJump to:\n\n\n- [1981 Tokyo](/episodes/discord-1-year-anniversary/#1981-tokyo)\n- [bsterthegawd](/episodes/discord-1-year-anniversary/#bsterthegawd)\n- [sans](/episodes/discord-1-year-anniversary/#sans)\n- [Ken Mac](/episodes/discord-1-year-anniversary/#ken-mac)\n- [Marco Pedro](/episodes/discord-1-year-anniversary/#marco-pedro)\n\nArtwork by [@TRACKSTAR](https://www.instagram.com/trackstar.global/).\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":21600,"location":null,"published_at":"2021-04-17T14:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Ken Mac","position":3}},{"id":"sJlLbPBJW4M","position":2,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Toro y Moi - Miss me (Feat. ABRA)","track":{"id":"vrBzZK6dfos","path":"/artists/toro-y-moi/tracks/miss-me-feat-abra/","slug":"miss-me-feat-abra","title":"Miss me (Feat. ABRA)","artist":{"slug":"toro-y-moi","title":"Toro y Moi"},"artwork":"images/artists/toro-y-moi/tracks/miss-me-feat-abra.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"kSD-hwFj9to","slug":"500-discord-edition","tags":[10,3,10],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soul-lyfans/sets/soulection-discord-show-500"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #500 (Discord edition)","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-show-500-discord-edition.jpg","content":"\nSoulection Discord organizes for a night of community DJ's to warmup to Soulection Radio Show #500\n\n<!--more-->\n\nJump to:\n\n\n- [@Geena Marie#6661](/episodes/500-discord-edition/#geena-marie) - Maryland, Washington, D.C. 🇺🇸 \n- [@Lonny#7340](/episodes/500-discord-edition/#lonny) -\n- [@DJClyde#2827](/episodes/500-discord-edition/#dj-clyde) -\n- [@Kalo#4734](/episodes/500-discord-edition/#kalo) - Washington D.C. 🇺🇸 \n- [@jasmineluna222#5328](/episodes/500-discord-edition/#jasmine-luna) - Canada 🇨🇦\n- [@Datsunn#9889](/episodes/500-discord-edition/#datsuun) - Windsor, Canada 🇨🇦\n- [@hiimjae#7572](/episodes/500-discord-edition/#jae-doug) -\n- [@SAINT ANGELO#9693](/episodes/500-discord-edition/#saint-angelo) - \n\n\nArtwork by [@bosourd#1456](https://www.instagram.com/bosourd/) [SC](https://soundcloud.com/bosourd)\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":21600,"location":"UN","published_at":"2021-04-10T14:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Lonny","position":1}},{"id":"4_KBGqTrNpw","position":92,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Toro Y Moi - Day One","track":{"id":"xp176E5v_ho","path":"/artists/toro-y-moi/tracks/day-one/","slug":"day-one","title":"Day One","artist":{"slug":"toro-y-moi","title":"Toro y Moi"},"artwork":"images/artists/toro-y-moi/tracks/day-one.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"-M58cuvh5dI","slug":"143","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-143"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #143","artwork":"/images/episodes/143.jpg","content":"Joe Kay focuses playing dropping just over 100 tracks in 3 hours \n\n<!--more-->\n\nIt's been about 3 months or more since there has been no guest on Soulection Radio. \nIt's been an amazing journey of having so many different personalities roll through the station and educate us with their production, selections, knowledge, and experiences. \nThis week Joe Kay wanted to let loose and focus strictly on his selection. Within 3 hours Joe dropped just over 100 tracks, that's right over 100! \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10796,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-31T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"uPxKMOYLxac","position":90,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Toro Y Moi - Day One","track":{"id":"xp176E5v_ho","path":"/artists/toro-y-moi/tracks/day-one/","slug":"day-one","title":"Day One","artist":{"slug":"toro-y-moi","title":"Toro y Moi"},"artwork":"images/artists/toro-y-moi/tracks/day-one.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"6HHQNRsrLR0","slug":"146","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-146"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #146","artwork":"/images/episodes/146.jpg","content":"Joe Kay hits hard with 3 hours of HEAVY tracks on 1 hour of sleep\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThere is something for everybody in here. Lots of unreleased music + music that was forgotten about. Shouts to all the amazing people who tuned in to the live show. Every once in a while we like to make a post about the location of our radio listeners and it's always inspiring to see how many people are actually tuning in and the locations that they reside in. We can't even pronounce some of the cities/countries! Talk about worldwide. Lets keep it moving.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10814,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-09-28T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"54ZVsCkNCNg","position":23,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Toro Y Moi - Day One (Joe Kay's 2nd Phase Slowed Vibe)","track":{"id":"PXcuclFIUEo","path":"/artists/toro-y-moi/tracks/day-one-joe-kay-s-2nd-phase-slowed-vibe/","slug":"day-one-joe-kays-2nd-phase-slowed-vibe","title":"Day One (Joe Kay's 2nd Phase Slowed Vibe)","artist":{"slug":"toro-y-moi","title":"Toro y Moi"},"artwork":"images/artists/toro-y-moi/tracks/day-one-joe-kay-s-2nd-phase-slowed-vibe.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"9uuATI0cyb4","slug":"149","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-149-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #149 w/ House Shoes","artwork":"/images/episodes/149.jpg","content":"\nThe pioneer/legendary House Shoes kicks off exclusives from label Street Corner Music.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nThis man's musical selections, experiences/knowledge, and blunt personality is one that you can't deny. \n\nWe respect House Shoes! It was nice to finally have him come by and drop two different sets (that's right two!). \n\nHe kicked it off with exclusives from his new label Street Corner Music and then ended with some nice soulful joints. \n\nJoe Kay's discussion with Shoes also touched on many great subjects that many of you wanted to know. Enjoy.\n\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10822,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-10-26T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"o06k_jVLsOQ","position":50,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Toro Y Moi - So Many Details","track":{"id":"EpbOx2AHANc","path":"/artists/toro-y-moi/tracks/so-many-details/","slug":"so-many-details","title":"So Many Details","artist":{"slug":"toro-y-moi","title":"Toro y Moi"},"artwork":"images/artists/toro-y-moi/tracks/so-many-details.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"Bd4yLv8Leyg","slug":"171","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-171"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #171","artwork":"/images/episodes/171.jpg","content":"Joe Kay returned with an immense amount and plenty of new ideas/inspiration after Coachella Weekend 1. \n\n<!--more-->\n\nThere are so many new gems in here. We also recently discovered this new platform/label out of Sydney called: [@flowfi](https://soundcloud.com/flowfi) (Accidentally spelled them out wrong on the show as F-L-O), but these guys are coming with HEAT. Make sure you pay attention to them. If you feel this whole session please share. Lets keep educating people with real music. Catch you next week at the same time.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10801,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-04-19T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}},{"id":"TkQAlD9WH5c","position":4,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Toro Y Moi - Day One","track":{"id":"xp176E5v_ho","path":"/artists/toro-y-moi/tracks/day-one/","slug":"day-one","title":"Day One","artist":{"slug":"toro-y-moi","title":"Toro y Moi"},"artwork":"images/artists/toro-y-moi/tracks/day-one.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"ds5J8Q4FpEQ","slug":"174","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-174-w-iman-omari"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #174 w/ Iman Omari","artwork":"/images/episodes/174.jpg","content":"Playing many tracks across 4 Sets\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":11043,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-05-10T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"9gGcmlrCiCU","position":49,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Toro Y Moi - Saturday Love","track":{"id":"KibS94XPXjo","path":"/artists/toro-y-moi/tracks/saturday-love/","slug":"saturday-love","title":"Saturday Love","artist":{"slug":"toro-y-moi","title":"Toro y Moi"},"artwork":"images/artists/toro-y-moi/tracks/saturday-love.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"eMlUtMnJUio","slug":"176","t